'''Lillie''' (Japanese: '''リーリエ''' ''Lilie'') is a {{TCGP|Supporter}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Celestial Guardians}} expansion.

==Card text==
{{TCGTrainerText
|class=Supporter
|rule=SWSH Supporter
|effect=Heal 60 damage from 1 of your Stage 2 Pokémon.
}}

