==Trivia==
*This card's immersive illustration includes [[Nebby]], {{p|Rowlet}}, {{p|Litten}}, {{p|Popplio}}, [[Hau]], [[Mallow]], {{p|Steenee}}, [[Lana]], {{p|Araquanid}}, [[Kiawe]], {{rf|Alolan}} {{p|Marowak}}, [[Sophocles]], {{p|Togedemaru}}, [[Ilima]], {{p|Yungoos}}, [[Acerola]], {{p|Mimikyu}}, [[Professor Kukui]], {{p|Silvally}}, and [[Gladion]].
*The {{rar/TCGP|Star|3}} prints of this card and {{TCG ID|Celestial Guardians|Guzma|208}} are the first {{TCGP|immersive card|immersive}} {{TCGP|Supporter card}}s in the game; all immersive cards released prior had been {{TCG|Pokémon}} cards. Only Lillie was revealed in pre-release announcements and trailers.
* {{TCG|Lillie}} also exists in the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]], but has a different effect.

===Origin===
*[[Lillie]] is an [[friend|ally]] character in {{game4|SMUSUM}}. Lillie's "Z-powered form" is featured in the {{TCGP|Deluxe Pack: ex}} Super rare print's illustration.

